Agentico SSH module, Android
Copyright 2026 Agentico contributors

The Kotlin sources under src/ are new code: the Android twin of the iOS Expo
bridge in ../ios/Module (the same JavaScript contract, src/bridge.ts), under the
Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE in this directory), like that bridge.
src/main/java/com/jcraft/jsch/AgenticoSessionAccess.kt is one helper placed in
JSch's package to reach a package-private setter; it contains no JSch code.

Third-party components, fetched from Maven Central by build.gradle and keeping
their own licenses: JSch (com.github.mwiede:jsch, BSD-3-Clause, with ISC
jBCrypt and BSD-3-Clause JZlib parts) and the Bouncy Castle provider
(org.bouncycastle:bcprov-jdk18on, MIT-style Bouncy Castle licence). A release
build must ship their notices with the app.
